26 Apr 2026 10:33:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-1-shangzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“上治法”部分，论述头面五官等上焦病症的治法。核心思想是&lt;strong&gt;治上焦之症，不必全责本脏，而重在上清邪气、开散壅滞，或以局部外治直达病所&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>